<title>ITALY: Gross yields rise at Italy CTZ bill auctions.</title>
<headline>Gross yields rise at Italy CTZ bill auctions.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the 1.5 trillion lire auction of a ninth tranche of 18-month October 15, 1998 Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ), and 2.0 trillion lire auction of a fifth tranche of May 14, 1999 two-year CTZs.</p>
<p>		    Oct 15, 98  Pvs	  May 14, 99  Pvs</p>
<p>Net Yield	 5.68 pct    5.58	 5.69 pct    5.62</p>
<p>Gross Yield     6.51	  6.41	 6.48	  6.41</p>
<p>Assigned price 91.95	 91.80	88.70	 88.55</p>
<p>Bids	     3.926 trillion lire     4.442 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned	 1.500 trillion lire     2.000 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Results compare with a previous auction on May 27.</p>
</text>
